const cio=new IntersectionObserver(es=>es.forEach(e=>{if(!e.isIntersecting)return;cio.unobserve(e.target);const el=e.target,n=+el.dataset.n,t0=performance.now();(function s(t){const p=Math.min((t-t0)/1500,1);el.textContent=Math.round(n*(1-Math.pow(1-p,3)));if(p<1)requestAnimationFrame(s)})(t0)}),{threshold:.6});
